+        /* A second context while one is current (a game switching contexts: create the new one,
+         * make it current, delete the old one). The host has one context for the window, so the
+         * new one is that context again, under the same handle: making it current rebinds it, and
+         * deleting the old one while it is current is ignored as before. Nothing goes to the host,
